sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant SDK as CodeFlare SDK
    participant Auth as kube-authkit<br/>AuthConfig
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>Server
    participant Kueue as Kueue API<br/>kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta1
    participant Ray as Ray Cluster<br/>Dashboard
    participant Secrets as Kubernetes<br/>Secrets

    Note over User,Secrets: 1. Authentication Flow
    User->>SDK: Initialize SDK
    SDK->>Auth: Auto-detect auth strategy<br/>(in-cluster / kubeconfig / Bearer token)
    Auth->>K8s: Authenticate<br/>TLS verified (system trust store /<br/>CF_SDK_CA_CERT_PATH / workbench CA bundle)
    K8s-->>Auth: Authenticated session
    Auth-->>SDK: Kubernetes client ready

    Note over User,Secrets: 2. Certificate Provisioning Flow
    User->>SDK: Request Ray cluster TLS setup
    SDK->>SDK: Generate self-signed CA<br/>RSA-3072, SHA-256
    SDK->>SDK: Generate server/client keypairs
    SDK->>Secrets: Store certs as Secret<br/>label: ray.openshift.ai/cluster-name
    Secrets-->>SDK: Secret created

    Note over User,Secrets: 3. Kueue Queue Management Flow
    User->>SDK: Query available queues
    SDK->>Kueue: List LocalQueues<br/>(kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta1)
    Kueue-->>SDK: LocalQueue list
    SDK->>Kueue: List WorkloadPriorityClasses
    Kueue-->>SDK: Priority classes
    SDK->>SDK: Resolve default queue<br/>(by annotation)
    SDK->>SDK: Inject kueue.x-k8s.io/queue-name<br/>label into workload metadata
    SDK-->>User: Queue info + validation result

    Note over User,Secrets: 4. Ray Job Submission Flow
    User->>SDK: Submit job via RayJobClient
    SDK->>Ray: POST job submission<br/>HTTP/HTTPS with custom headers
    Ray-->>SDK: Job ID + status
    User->>SDK: Monitor job
    SDK->>Ray: GET job status
    Ray-->>SDK: Job progress/result
    SDK-->>User: Job result
